# 📖 TOEIC Grammar - Day33

## Topic
# 수동태
### Passive Voice

---

## 1. 수동태란?

행동을 하는 사람이 아니라
**행동을 받는 대상**을 주어로 표현하는 문장이다.

### 능동태

The company developed the product.

→ 회사가 제품을 개발했다.

### 수동태

The product was developed by the company.

→ 제품이 회사에 의해 개발되었다.

---

## 2. 기본 구조

### be + p.p.

The report **was completed** yesterday.

The documents **are stored** here.

---

## 3. 시제에 따른 수동태

### 현재

am / is / are + p.p.

The report **is reviewed** every week.

### 과거

was / were + p.p.

The report **was reviewed** yesterday.

### 현재완료

has / have been + p.p.

The report **has been reviewed**.

### 미래

will be + p.p.

The report **will be reviewed** tomorrow.

---

## 4. 4형식 수동태

능동:

The company gave employees a bonus.

→ 회사가 직원들에게 보너스를 주었다.

수동:

Employees were given a bonus.

또는

A bonus was given to employees.

---

## 5. 5형식 수동태

능동:

The manager found the proposal useful.

→ 관리자는 그 제안이 유용하다고 생각했다.

수동:

The proposal was found useful.

---

## 6. TOEIC 핵심

수동태 문제에서는

### 1단계
주어가 행동을 하는지
행동을 받는지 확인

### 2단계
시제 확인

### 3단계
be + p.p. 형태 확인

---

## 자주 나오는 표현

be required to
→ ~하도록 요구되다

be expected to
→ ~할 것으로 예상되다

be allowed to
→ ~하도록 허용되다

be asked to
→ ~하도록 요청받다

be scheduled to
→ ~할 예정으로 잡혀 있다

---

## Examples

Employees are required to wear uniforms.

The meeting is scheduled to begin at 9 a.m.

Customers are allowed to return the product within 30 days.

